T1  - Growth and body composition of dairy calves fed only milk replacer at 3 intakes.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.3168/jds.2024-24894
A1  - Bartlett, K S
A1  - McKeith, F K
A1  - Molano, R A
A1  - Van Amburgh, M E
A1  - VandeHaar, M J
A1  - Dahl, G E
