T1  - Interaction between plasma phospholipid odd-chain fatty acids and GAD65 autoantibodies on the incidence of adult-onset diabetes: the EPIC-InterAct case-cohort study.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1007/s00125-023-05948-x
A1  - Lampousi, Anna-Maria
