T1  - The effects of low-fat dairy products fortified with 1500 IU vitamin D3 on serum liver function biomarkers in adults with abdominal obesity: a randomized controlled trial.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1186/s41043-023-00401-6
A1  - Sharifan, Payam
A1  - Darroudi, Susan
A1  - Rafiee, Mahdi
A1  - Roustai Geraylow, Kiarash
