T1  - Efficacy of an aloe vera, chamomile, and thyme cosmetic cream for the prophylaxis and treatment of mild dermatitis induced by radiation therapy in breast cancer patients (the Alantel study).
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.conctc.2024.101288
A1  - Villegas-Becerril, E
A1  - Jimenez-Garcia, C
A1  - Perula-de Torres, L A
