T1  - The effect of conjugated linoleic acids on inflammation, oxidative stress, body composition and physical performance: a comprehensive review of putative molecular mechanisms.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1186/s12986-023-00758-9
A1  - Putera, Husna Dharma
A1  - Doewes, Rumi Iqbal
A1  - Shalaby, Mohammed Nader
