T1  - The Stance4Health Project: Evaluating a Smart Personalised Nutrition Service for Gut Microbiota Modulation in Normal- and Overweight Adults and Children with Obesity, Gluten-Related Disorders or Allergy/Intolerance to Cow's Milk.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.3390/foods11101480
A1  - Dello Russo, Marika
A1  - Russo, Paola
A1  - Rufian-Henares, Jose Angel
A1  - Hinojosa-Nogueira, Daniel
