T1  - Agave fructans enhance the effects of fermented milk products on obesity biomarkers: a randomised trial.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.3920/BM2022.0078
A1  - Vega-Cardenas, M
A1  - Martinez-Gutierrez, F
A1  - Lara-Ramirez, E E
A1  - Reynaga-Hernandez, E
A1  - Yanez-Estrada, L
A1  - Ratering, S
