T1  - Effects of a multicomponent resistance-based exercise program with protein, vitamin D and calcium supplementation on cognition in men with prostate cancer treated with ADT: secondary analysis of a 12-month randomised controlled trial.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1136/bmjopen-2021-060189
A1  - Mundell, Niamh Liana
A1  - Owen, Patrick J
A1  - Dalla Via, Jack
