T1  - Activity and safety of topical pimecrolimus in patients with early stage mycosis fungoides (PimTo-MF): a single-arm, multicentre, phase 2 trial.
T3  - Comment in: Lancet Haematol. 2022 Jun;9(6):e389-e391 PMID: 35654069 [https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/35654069]
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/S2352-3026(22)00107-7
A1  - Ortiz-Romero, Pablo L
A1  - Maronas Jimenez, Lidia
A1  - Muniesa, Cristina
A1  - Estrach, Teresa
