T1  - Gestational Diabetes Mellitus Is Associated with Altered Abundance of Exosomal MicroRNAs in Human Milk.
T3  - Erratum in: Clin Ther. 2022 Jul;44(7):1034 PMID: 35595570 [https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/35595570]
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.clinthera.2022.01.005
A1  - Shah, Kruti B
A1  - Fields, David A
A1  - Pezant, Nathan P
A1  - Kharoud, Harmeet K
A1  - Gulati, Shelly
A1  - Jacobs, Katherine
A1  - Gale, Cheryl A
A1  - Kharbanda, Elyse O
