T1  - Diet quality and exercise in older veterans with PTSD: a pilot study.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1093/tbm/ibab116
A1  - Browne, Julia
A1  - Morey, Miriam C
A1  - Beckham, Jean C
A1  - Bosworth, Hayden B
