T1  - The effects of consuming a low-fat yogurt fortified with nano encapsulated vitamin D on serum pro-oxidant-antioxidant balance (PAB) in adults with metabolic syndrome; a randomized control trial.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.dsx.2021.102332
A1  - Taghizadeh, Niloofar
A1  - Sharifan, Payam
A1  - Ekhteraee Toosi, Mansoureh Sadat
