T1  - Influence of Cow's Milk and Esomeprazole on the Absorption of Erlotinib: A Randomized, Crossover Pharmacokinetic Study in Lung Cancer Patients.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1007/s40262-020-00910-1
A1  - Veerman, G D Marijn
A1  - Hussaarts, Koen G A M
A1  - Peric, Robert
