T1  - The impact of diets rich in low-fat or full-fat dairy on glucose tolerance and its determinants: a randomized controlled trial.
T3  - Comment in: Am J Clin Nutr. 2021 Mar 11;113(3):495-496 PMID: 33515013 [https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/33515013]
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1093/ajcn/nqaa301
A1  - Schmidt, Kelsey A
A1  - Cromer, Gail
A1  - Burhans, Maggie S
A1  - Kuzma, Jessica N
A1  - Hagman, Derek K
A1  - Fernando, Imashi
