T1  - Milk polar lipids favorably alter circulating and intestinal ceramide and sphingomyelin species in postmenopausal women.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1172/jci.insight.146161
A1  - Le Barz, Melanie
A1  - Vors, Cecile
