T1  - The effectiveness of EVOSKIN RPalm and sole moisturizing cream in treating capecitabine-associated hand-foot syndrome: a randomized double-blind clinical trial.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.21037/apm-21-61
A1  - Lu, Weiqun
A1  - Huang, Zhiliang
A1  - Chen, Shicai
A1  - Lv, Huizeng
