T1  - Low-dose thiamine supplementation of lactating Cambodian mothers improves human milk thiamine concentrations: a randomized controlled trial.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1093/ajcn/nqab052
A1  - Gallant, Jelisa
A1  - Chan, Kathleen
A1  - Green, Tim J
