T1  - Postprandial Fatty Acid Profile, but Not Cardiometabolic Risk Markers, Is Modulated by Dairy Fat Manipulation in Adults with Moderate Cardiovascular Disease Risk: The Randomized Controlled REplacement of SaturatEd fat in dairy on Total cholesterol (RESET) Study.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1093/jn/nxab050
A1  - Markey, Oonagh
A1  - Vasilopoulou, Dafni
A1  - Kliem, Kirsty E
