T3  - Comment in: Integr Cancer Ther. 2021 Jan-Dec;20:15347354211026976 PMID: 34493110 [https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/34493110]
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1177/1534735420940412
A1  - Steinmann, Diana
