T1  - Effect of a novel functional tomato sauce (OsteoCol) from vine-ripened tomatoes on serum lipids in individuals with common hypercholesterolemia: tomato sauce and hypercholesterolemia.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1186/s12967-020-02676-3
A1  - Ferro, Yvelise
A1  - Mazza, Elisa
A1  - Angotti, Elvira
A1  - Pujia, Roberta
