T1  - Effects of low doses of fish and milk proteins on glucose regulation and markers of insulin sensitivity in overweight adults: a randomised, double blind study.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1007/s00394-019-01963-0
A1  - Hovland, Ida Heir
A1  - Leikanger, Ingrid Sande
A1  - Stokkeland, Oddbjorg
A1  - Waage, Kaia Hevroy
