T1  - Effect of urea cream on sorafenib-associated hand-foot skin reaction in patients with hepatocellular carcinoma: A multicenter, randomised, double-blind controlled study.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.ejca.2020.09.012
A1  - Lee, Young-Sun
A1  - Jung, Young K
A1  - Kim, Ji H
A1  - Cho, Sung B
A1  - Kim, Do Y
A1  - Kim, Moon Y
A1  - Kim, Hyung J
A1  - Seo, Yeon S
