T1  - Blood cadmium levels and sources of exposure in an adult urban population in southern Brazil.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.envres.2020.109618
A1  - Martins, Airton C
A1  - Urbano, Mariana R
A1  - Almeida Lopes, Ana Carolina B
A1  - Carvalho, Maria de Fatima H
