T1  - Effect of milk fat on LDL cholesterol and other cardiovascular risk markers in healthy humans: the INNOVALAIT project.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1038/s41430-019-0528-4
A1  - Bard, Jean-Marie
A1  - Drouet, Ludovic
A1  - Lairon, Denis
A1  - Cazaubiel, Murielle
A1  - Marmonier, Corinne
A1  - Ninio, Ewa
A1  - Bal Dit Sollier, Claire
A1  - Martin, Jean-Charles
