T1  - Results from the randomized controlled IHOPE trial suggest no effects of oral protein supplementation and exercise training on physical function in hemodialysis patients.
T3  - Comment in: Kidney Int. 2019 Sep;96(3):549-552 PMID: 31445582 [https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/31445582]
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.kint.2019.03.018
A1  - Jeong, Jin Hee
