T3  - Comment in: J Hum Lact. 2020 Feb;36(1):196 PMID: 31596640 [https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/31596640] Comment in: J Hum Lact. 2020 Feb;36(1):195 PMID: 31596654 [https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/31596654]
