T1  - Obesity and mental health improvement following nutritional education focusing on gut microbiota composition in Japanese women: a randomised controlled trial.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1007/s00394-018-1873-0
A1  - Uemura, Mayu
A1  - Hayashi, Fumikazu
A1  - Ishioka, Ken
