T1  - Longitudinal association of changes in diet with changes in body weight and waist circumference in subjects at high cardiovascular risk: the PREDIMED trial.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1186/s12966-019-0893-3
A1  - Konieczna, Jadwiga
A1  - Romaguera, Dora
A1  - Pereira, Veronica
A1  - Fiol, Miguel
A1  - Razquin, Cristina
