T1  - A randomized, multinational, noninferiority, phase III trial to evaluate the safety and efficacy of BF-200 aminolaevulinic acid gel vs. methyl aminolaevulinate cream in the treatment of nonaggressive basal cell carcinoma with photodynamic therapy.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1111/bjd.16441
A1  - Morton, C A
A1  - Dominicus, R
A1  - Radny, P
A1  - Dirschka, T
A1  - Hauschild, A
A1  - Reinhold, U
A1  - Aschoff, R
