T1  - Five-Year Results of a Randomized Controlled Trial Comparing Effectiveness of Photodynamic Therapy, Topical Imiquimod, and Topical 5-Fluorouracil in Patients with Superficial Basal Cell Carcinoma.
T3  - Comment in: J Invest Dermatol. 2018 Mar;138(3):484-486 PMID: 29395168 [https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/29395168]
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.jid.2017.09.033
A1  - Jansen, Maud H E
A1  - Mosterd, Klara
A1  - Arits, Aimee H M M
A1  - Roozeboom, Marieke H
A1  - Sommer, Anja
A1  - Essers, Brigitte A B
A1  - van Pelt, Han P A
A1  - Quaedvlieg, Patricia J F
