T1  - Probiotic reduces bacterial translocation in type 2 diabetes mellitus: A randomised controlled study.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1038/s41598-017-12535-9
A1  - Sato, Junko
A1  - Kanazawa, Akio
A1  - Azuma, Kosuke
A1  - Ikeda, Fuki
A1  - Goto, Hiromasa
A1  - Komiya, Koji
