T1  - Isocaloric Diets High in Animal or Plant Protein Reduce Liver Fat and Inflammation in Individuals With Type 2 Diabetes.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1053/j.gastro.2016.10.007
A1  - Markova, Mariya
A1  - Pivovarova, Olga
A1  - Hornemann, Silke
