T1  - Associations of the MCM6-rs3754686 proxy for milk intake in Mediterranean and American populations with cardiovascular biomarkers, disease and mortality: Mendelian randomization.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1038/srep33188
A1  - Smith, Caren E
A1  - Coltell, Oscar
A1  - Sorli, Jose V
A1  - Estruch, Ramon
A1  - Martinez-Gonzalez, Miguel Angel
A1  - Salas-Salvado, Jordi
