T1  - Daylight photodynamic therapy with methyl aminolevulinate cream is effective and nearly painless in treating actinic keratoses: a randomised, investigator-blinded, controlled, phase III study throughout Europe.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1111/jdv.13228
A1  - Lacour, J-P
A1  - Ulrich, C
A1  - Gilaberte, Y
A1  - Von Felbert, V
