T1  - Consumption of Yogurt, Low-Fat Milk, and Other Low-Fat Dairy Products Is Associated with Lower Risk of Metabolic Syndrome Incidence in an Elderly Mediterranean Population.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.3945/jn.115.214593
A1  - Babio, Nancy
