T1  - Three-Arm Randomized Phase III Trial: Quality Aloe and Placebo Cream Versus Powder as Skin Treatment During Breast Cancer Radiation Therapy.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.clbc.2014.12.006
A1  - Hoopfer, Donna
A1  - Holloway, Caroline
A1  - Gabos, Zsolt
