T1  - Association of dietary patterns with insulin resistance and clinically silent carotid atherosclerosis in apparently healthy people.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1038/ejcn.2013.172
A1  - Buscemi, S
A1  - Nicolucci, A
A1  - Mattina, A
