T1  - Randomized placebo-controlled intervention with n-3 LC-PUFA-supplemented yoghurt: effects on circulating eicosanoids and cardiovascular risk factors.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.clnu.2012.12.010
A1  - Dawczynski, Christine
