T1  - Topical vitamin K1 may not be effective in preventing acneiform rash during cetuximab treatment in patients with metastatic colorectal cancer.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1684/ejd.2012.1899
A1  - Jo, Jae-Cheol
A1  - Hong, Yong Sang
A1  - Kim, Kyu-pyo
A1  - Lee, Jae-Lyun
A1  - Kim, Hwa Jung
A1  - Lee, Mi-Woo
