T1  - Acute differential effects of milk-derived dietary proteins on postprandial lipaemia in obese non-diabetic subjects.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1038/ejcn.2011.142
A1  - Holmer-Jensen, J
A1  - Hartvigsen, M L
