T1  - Association of dietary factors and other coronary risk factors with social class in women in five Indian cities.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1046/j.1440-6047.2000.00177.x
A1  - Singh, R B
A1  - Beegom, R
A1  - Verma, S P
A1  - Haque, M
A1  - Singh, R
A1  - Mehta, A S
A1  - De, A K
