T1  - Differential effect of cheese fatty acid composition on blood lipid profile and redox status in normolipidemic volunteers: a pilot study.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.3109/09637486.2011.569491
A1  - Intorre, Federica
A1  - Foddai, Maria Stella
A1  - Azzini, Elena
