T1  - A combination of (omega-3) polyunsaturated fatty acids, polyphenols and L-carnitine reduces the plasma lipid levels and increases the expression of genes involved in fatty acid oxidation in human peripheral blood mononuclear cells and HepG2 cells.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1159/000327150
A1  - Radler, Ulla
