T1  - Topical treatment of Basal cell carcinomas in nevoid Basal cell carcinoma syndrome with a smoothened inhibitor.
T3  - Comment in: J Invest Dermatol. 2011 Aug;131(8):1592 PMID: 21753761 [https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/21753761]
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1038/jid.2011.48
A1  - Skvara, Hans
A1  - Kalthoff, Frank
A1  - Meingassner, Josef G
A1  - Wolff-Winiski, Barbara
A1  - Aschauer, Heinrich
A1  - Kelleher, Joseph F
