T1  - Lower protein in infant formula is associated with lower weight up to age 2 y: a randomized clinical trial.
T3  - Comment in: Am J Clin Nutr. 2009 Jun;89(6):1719-20 PMID: 19386742 [https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/19386742]
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.3945/ajcn.2008.27091
A1  - Koletzko, Berthold
A1  - von Kries, Rudiger
A1  - Closa, Ricardo
A1  - Escribano, Joaquin
A1  - Scaglioni, Silvia
A1  - Giovannini, Marcello
A1  - Beyer, Jeannette
A1  - Demmelmair, Hans
A1  - Gruszfeld, Dariusz
