T1  - LIPGENE food-exchange model for alteration of dietary fat quantity and quality in free-living participants from eight European countries.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1017/S0007114508039962
A1  - Shaw, Danielle I
A1  - Tierney, Audrey C
A1  - McCarthy, Sinead
