T1  - Effect of low-fat, fermented milk enriched with plant sterols on serum lipid profile and oxidative stress in moderate hypercholesterolemia.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1093/ajcn/86.3.790
A1  - Hansel, Boris
A1  - Nicolle, Catherine
A1  - Lalanne, Florent
A1  - Tondu, Francoise
