T1  - High consumptions of grain, fish, dairy products and combinations of these are associated with a low prevalence of metabolic syndrome.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1136/jech.2006.052126
A1  - Ruidavets, Jean-Bernard
A1  - Bongard, Vanina
A1  - Dallongeville, Jean
