T1  - Randomized controlled safety and efficacy trial of 2 vitamin A supplementation schedules in Tanzanian infants.
T3  - Comment in: Am J Clin Nutr. 2007 Oct;86(4):1254 PMID: 17921415 [https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/17921415]
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1093/ajcn/85.5.1312
A1  - Idindili, Boniphace
