T1  - Effect of Kluyveromyces marxianus YIT 8292 crude cell wall fraction on serum lipids in normocholesterolemic and mildly hypercholesterolemic subjects.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1271/bbb.60539
A1  - Yoshida, Yasuto
A1  - Naito, Eiichiro
A1  - Ohishi, Kenji
