T1  - Increased alpha-linolenic acid intake lowers C-reactive protein, but has no effect on markers of atherosclerosis.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1038/sj.ejcn.1601938
A1  - Bemelmans, W J E
A1  - Lefrandt, J D
